<title>BULGARIA: WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - AUGUST 19 - WARM.</title>
<headline>WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - AUGUST 19 - WARM.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cloudy with sunny spells across the country, rain expected in the west, state radio said.</p>
<p>Maximum temperatures are expected between 27 and 32 degrees, temperature in Sofia is seen at about 26 degrees.</p>
<p>Air temperatures along the Black Sea coast are expected around 25 degrees. -- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
